BamDoodle word lists

The word lists in this folder are written and curated for BamDoodle and licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Sources used to find, rank or check words (scripts in scripts/words/):

- Wikidata, https://www.wikidata.org, CC0 1.0. Candidates and their Dutch and English
  names for everyday things, technology, films, series, cartoons, games, countries and
  cities, ranked by how many Wikipedias have an article about them.
- Open English WordNet, https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet, CC BY 4.0,
  based on Princeton WordNet (WordNet 3.0 licence, Princeton University). English check.
- OpenTaal word list, https://github.com/OpenTaal/opentaal-wordlist, BSD-3-Clause or
  CC BY 3.0, Stichting OpenTaal. Dutch spelling check.
- FrequencyWords, https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, MIT, Hermit Dave.
  How common a word is, in English and Dutch.
- List of Dirty, Naughty, Obscene, and Otherwise Bad Words,
  https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words,
  CC BY 4.0, Shutterstock. Inspiration for the 18+ categories and a check against slurs.

Brand, attraction, game, meme and people's names (Logos, Efteling, trivia) are only used as
words to draw.
